    "answer": {
      "short": "$-\\dfrac34$",
      "worked": "The second marked point is $8$ units right and $6$ units down from $(-4,3)$, so it is $(4,-3)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}m&=\\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\\\m&=\\frac{-3-3}{4-(-4)}\\\\m&=\\frac{-6}{8}\\\\m&=-\\frac34\\end{align*}$$",
